{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y压缩掉了一些关键心理因果，尤其是S05、S06、S11和S13，人物为什么改变心意、前后如何相连，不如X交代得清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"边听钢琴边扫屏时，Y的短句和放大高亮词更容易让我立刻抓住每段的情绪转折，感受又随着音乐分时出现，能捕捉到更细的声音变化、身体感觉和情绪层次，而不必一次读完所有短词。X的优势是人物心理有更完整的因果链：为什么收住、为什么害怕、为什么后来不愿再藏，前后呼应也更明确。综合实际观看体验我选Y，但它有时让我知道人物变了，却不如X让我充分明白他为什么会变。\"\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a616b6d9-937d-4ef6-a54d-50a56b142792", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060257458245Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:03:40.782705+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b4f208ff358b15eead4aaa695d85069c0afcf991f570fc873c8993db44ed6d98", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py